<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Market Dispatch · 历史归档</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #F6F1E9; --paper: #FFFDF9; --tint: #EFE8DC;
    --ink: #1B1917; --ink-2: #44403C; --ink-3: #78716C;
    --rule: #DFD7C8; --rule-strong: #1B1917;
    --accent: #990F3D; --accent-soft: #F9EBF0;
    --gold: #9A5B06;
    --serif: Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", "Noto Serif CJK SC", "Times New Roman", serif;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"] {
    --bg: #121316; --paper: #191B20; --tint: #23262E;
    --ink: #EDE8DF; --ink-2: #BEB7AC; --ink-3: #857F76;
    --rule: #2D313B; --rule-strong: #C9C0AE;
    --accent: #E26B8D; --accent-soft: #2D1D24;
    --gold: #E3AA4F;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; transition: background .2s, color .2s; }
  .container { max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px 48px; }

  .topbar { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); }
  .topbar-inner { max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 13px; }
  .edition-tabs { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .edition-label { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 12px; margin-right: 6px; }
  .ed-tab { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 3px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-2); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ed-tab:hover { background: var(--tint); color: var(--ink); }
  .live-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22C55E; display: inline-block; }
  .ed-tab .cnt { font-size: 11px; opacity: .72; }
  .topbar-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .archive-active { color: var(--paper); background: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .theme-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--ink-2); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12.5px; cursor: pointer; }
  .theme-btn:hover { background: var(--tint); color: var(--ink); }

  .masthead { padding: 24px 0 0; text-align: center; }
  .masthead-kicker { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .24em; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .masthead h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px); letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .dateline { margin-top: 14px; border-top: 2px solid var(--rule-strong); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); padding: 8px 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .month-nav { margin-top: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .month-nav span { color: var(--ink-3); margin-right: 4px; }
  .m-btn { border: 1px solid var(--rule); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink-2); padding: 3px 11px; border-radius: 3px; cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; }
  .m-btn:hover { background: var(--tint); color: var(--ink); }
  .m-btn.active { background: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-weight: 600; }

  .month-sec { margin-top: 22px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-top: 2.5px solid var(--rule-strong); }
  .month-head { padding: 11px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; }
  .month-head h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; }
  .month-head span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); }

  table.arch { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13.5px; }
  table.arch th { text-align: left; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-3); background: var(--tint); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); font-family: var(--mono); }
  table.arch th.num, table.arch td.num { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  table.arch td { padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  table.arch tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  table.arch tbody tr:hover { background: var(--tint); }
  table.arch a.day-link { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--mono); }
  table.arch a.day-link:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .wk { color: var(--ink-3); font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; margin-left: 8px; }
  .star-n { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; }
  .tot-n { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }

  .empty-arch {
    margin-top: 24px; padding: 44px 20px; text-align: center;
    background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 14px;
  }

  footer { margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 2px solid var(--rule-strong); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  footer a { color: var(--ink-2); text-decoration: none; }
  footer a:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (max-width: 720px) { .hide-sm { display: none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="topbar" aria-label="版面切换">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <div class="edition-tabs">
      <span class="edition-label">近 {{ retention_days }} 天</span>
      {% for day in recent_days %}
      <a class="ed-tab" href="{{ day.href }}">
        {% if day.is_today %}<span class="live-dot"></span>{% endif %}{{ day.short_label }} <span class="cnt">{{ day.count }}</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-right">
      <span class="archive-active">历史归档</span>
      <button class="theme-btn" id="themeBtn" type="button">🌙 夜间版</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">
  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="masthead-kicker">BLOOMBERG · REUTERS · WSJ · ARCHIVE</div>
    <h1>Market Dispatch</h1>
    <div class="dateline">
      <span>超过 <b>{{ retention_days }} 天</b>的日报自动归档至此，文件全量保留不删除</span>
      <span>已归档 <b class="mono">{{ total_archived_days }}</b> 期 · 时区 <span class="mono">{{ timezone }}</span></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  {% if months %}
  <div class="month-nav" id="monthNav">
    <span>按月筛选：</span>
    <button class="m-btn active" data-month="all" type="button">全部月份</button>
    {% for m in months %}
    <button class="m-btn" data-month="{{ m.key }}" type="button">{{ m.key }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% for m in months %}
  <section class="month-sec" data-month="{{ m.key }}">
    <div class="month-head">
      <h2>{{ m.label }}</h2>
      <span>共 {{ m.count }} 期</span>
    </div>
    <table class="arch">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>日期</th>
          <th class="num hide-sm">📈 市场</th>
          <th class="num hide-sm">💻 科技</th>
          <th class="num hide-sm">🌍 世界</th>
          <th class="num hide-sm">🇺🇸 美国</th>
          <th class="num hide-sm">🇨🇳 中国</th>
          <th class="num">★ 要闻</th>
          <th class="num">总计</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for d in m.days %}
        <tr>
          <td><a class="day-link" href="{{ d.href }}">{{ d.date }}</a><span class="wk">{{ d.weekday_cn }}</span></td>
          <td class="num hide-sm">{{ d.markets }}</td>
          <td class="num hide-sm">{{ d.tech }}</td>
          <td class="num hide-sm">{{ d.world }}</td>
          <td class="num hide-sm">{{ d.us }}</td>
          <td class="num hide-sm">{{ d.china }}</td>
          <td class="num star-n">{{ d.important }}</td>
          <td class="num tot-n">{{ d.total }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
  <div class="empty-arch">
    当前暂无历史归档期数（最近 {{ retention_days }} 天的日报展示在顶部导航栏，第 {{ retention_days + 1 }} 天起自动归档至此）。
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <footer>
    <div>Market Dispatch（market-dispatch）· 归档索引按月自动刷新 · 仅供个人学习研究</div>
    <div><a href="../index.html">← 返回今日日报</a></div>
  </footer>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  const root = document.documentElement, btn = document.getElementById('themeBtn');
  function set(t){ root.setAttribute('data-theme', t); btn.textContent = t === 'dark' ? '☀️ 日间版' : '🌙 夜间版'; try{localStorage.setItem('md_theme', t);}catch(e){} }
  try{ if(localStorage.getItem('md_theme') === 'dark') set('dark'); }catch(e){}
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => set(root.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'));

  document.querySelectorAll('#monthNav .m-btn').forEach(b => {
    b.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.querySelectorAll('#monthNav .m-btn').forEach(x => x.classList.remove('active'));
      b.classList.add('active');
      const m = b.dataset.month;
      document.querySelectorAll('section.month-sec').forEach(sec => {
        sec.style.display = (m === 'all' || sec.dataset.month === m) ? '' : 'none';
      });
    });
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
